<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AUTOMAKERS SAYS DEVELOPMENTS PENDING.</title>
<headline>AUTOMAKERS SAYS DEVELOPMENTS PENDING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automakers Ltd on Thursday strongly urged shareholders not to trade in the company's shares as it said certain developments currently being contemplated could have a material impact on the price of shares.</p>
<p>It did not give further details in the brief announcement but said a full announcement giving full details on these developments would be made available during the course of next week.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
